  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "ContextAssemblyPlan Contract Spine v1",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Date**: 2026-05-18 **Schema**: `rig.context_assembly_plan.v1`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Purpose",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Provide the contract spine for context assembly planning so downstream lanes (discovery, scoring, budget, rendering, compression, provenance) can plug in without inventing ad hoc dictionaries.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Models",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "ContextCandidate",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A discovered possible context item. Deterministic `candidate_id` derived from `path|kind|source|relation`. Carries `estimated_tokens`, `priority`, `risk_flags`, `trust_tier`, `cache_tier`. No raw content fields.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "ContextSelection",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A candidate selected for inclusion. Links to `candidate_id`, specifies `selected_tokens`, `include_mode` (full/summary/path_only/hash_only), `selection_reason`, and target `section_name`.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "ContextOmission",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A candidate omitted from the packet. Links to `candidate_id`, specifies `omission_reason` (budget_exceeded/disabled_by_scope/duplicate/risk_policy/unavailable/unsupported/not_relevant).",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "ContextBudgetLedger",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Token budget accounting: requested, used, remaining, selection overhead, compression ratio.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "ContextAssemblyPlan",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Full plan with `candidates`, `selections`, `omissions`, `budget`, `warnings`, `deterministic_inputs`. Carries `plan_sha256` and `selection_sha256` for content-addressed identity.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Hash Model",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `plan_sha256`: `sha256:<64 hex>` over all stable fields (excludes `plan_sha256`, `selection_sha256`, `generated_at`) - `selection_sha256`: `sha256:<64 hex>` over selections only - Candidate IDs: `sha256:<hex>` truncated to 20 chars, derived from `path|kind|source|relation` - `plan_id`: first 24 chars of `plan_sha256`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Cache Tiers",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-19",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Tier",
        "Meaning"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`stable`",
          "Static across many turns (committed files, schemas)"
        ],
        [
          "`semi_stable`",
          "Changes infrequently (work map, config)"
        ],
        [
          "`dynamic`",
          "Changes per turn (tool outputs, recent messages)"
        ],
        [
          "`volatile`",
          "Must be recomputed every time"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Trust Tiers",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-21",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Tier",
        "Meaning"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`first_party`",
          "Rig Relay internal (doctrine, governance)"
        ],
        [
          "`repo_content`",
          "User's repository files"
        ],
        [
          "`tool_output`",
          "Tool result content"
        ],
        [
          "`external`",
          "External provider/model output"
        ],
        [
          "`untrusted`",
          "Unknown origin, treat with caution"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Privacy Model",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "No raw content fields: `content`, `raw_text`, `stdout`, `stderr`, `env`, `cwd`, `token`, `output`, `file_contents`, `snippet`, `prompt` are excluded from all assembly plan models. Candidates are evidence/provenance descriptors, not content buckets.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Tests",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "`tests/context/test_context_assembly_plan.py` — 19 tests covering: - Candidate/selection/omission/plan rejects extra fields (4 tests) - Candidate ID determinism and uniqueness (3 tests) - Negative tokens rejected (2 tests) - Plan hash determinism and generated_at exclusion (2 tests) - Selection hash determinism (1 test) - JSON roundtrip (1 test) - Plan ID derivation (1 test) - No raw content fields on candidate/plan (2 tests) - Canonical hash stability (1 test) - Budget ledger negative validation (1 test)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Next Lanes",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Planner**: populate candidates from repo map, repo index, work map, recent messages - **Scorer**: compute priority from relation/trust/cache tiers - **Budget enforcer**: select candidates up to token budget, record omissions - **Renderer**: produce ContextRenderedSection from selections - **Provenance**: use plan_sha256 and selection_sha256 for cache invalidation",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
